<title>USA: McLeod Inc to offer $175 mln in common shrs.</title>
<headline>McLeod Inc to offer $175 mln in common shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>McLeod Inc said it plans to raise $175 million by offering additional shares of Class A Common Stock for sale to investors.</p>
<p>A concurrent secondary offering of 529,000 shares is planned by certain McLeod stockholders, the local and long distance services company said earlier on Thursday in a news release.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
